Comment: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.00,Title,,0,0,0,,============================ Title ============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:33.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(1482.934,379.515)}在异世界存
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:33.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(1362.934,573.515)}八万枚金币
Comment: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:30.97,Screen,,0,0,0,,============================ Screen ============================
